      "role": "user",
      "content": "the breathing helps a little i guess, but it's not always enough when things get really intense. sometimes the feeling is just so overwhelming that the breathing doesn't even touch it, and the static happens anyway. i'm worried that if i don't find something stronger, i'm eventually gonna cause a real accident or something.",
